{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Birinchishop Partner API","version":"2026-10-23","summary":"CPA affiliate network API for partners, trackers and AI agents.","description":"Programmatic access for Birinchishop partners (affiliates): browse offers, create tracking links, submit and track orders, read statistics, and receive status updates via webhooks or S2S postbacks.\n\nAuthentication: create an API key in the partner panel (Dashboard -> API) and send it as `Authorization: Bearer bsk_live_...`. Keys are scoped; grant only what you need. Keys must never be used from a browser or mobile app.\n\nAI agents: an MCP server (Model Context Protocol, Streamable HTTP) is available at `POST /api/v1/mcp` with the same key. It also exposes prompts (daily_review, find_offer, check_campaigns, order_problems) and resources.\n\nHuman in the loop: pausing a campaign is immediate; resuming it or changing its budget returns `202` with an action in status `pending_confirmation` — the partner confirms it in the Telegram bot or panel, poll `GET /actions/{action_id}`.\n\nAll responses: `{ \"data\": ..., \"meta\"?: ..., \"request_id\": \"...\" }`. Errors: `{ \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\", \"details\"? }, \"request_id\" }`. Branch on `error.code`, not on the message.\n\nBusiness rules: Customers pay on delivery (cash on delivery). A delivery fee (typically 30,000 UZS) is added to customer_price by the delivery partner. Payout is credited only when an order reaches \"delivered\"; if the status is later reverted, the payout is reversed. One phone number cannot order the same offer twice within 24 hours, and at most 3 different offers per 24 hours. Customer phone numbers are always masked for partners. Submitting orders via API (orders:write) requires at least 3 delivered orders on the account, or admin approval. Fake or test orders are forbidden and lead to account blocking.","contact":{"name":"Birinchishop support","url":"https://t.me/birinchishop_support"}},"servers":[{"url":"https://birinchishop.uz/api/v1"}],"security":[{"ApiKey":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"Account"},{"name":"Offers"},{"name":"Links"},{"name":"Orders"},{"name":"Stats"},{"name":"Events"},{"name":"Webhooks"},{"name":"AI","description":"AI manager recommendations and order sale chance."},{"name":"Ads","description":"Meta (Facebook/Instagram) ad campaigns. Spending-increasing actions require the partner's confirmation."},{"name":"Meta"}],"paths":{"/me":{"get":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"getAccount","summary":"Account, balance and key info","security":[{"ApiKey":["account:read"]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","request_id"],"properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Account"},"request_id":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/E401"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/E403"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/E429"}}}},"/offers":{"get":{"tags":["Offers"],"operationId":"listOffers","summary":"Search active offers","security":[{"ApiKey":["offers:read"]}],"parameters":[{"name":"search","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Product search (Uzbek Latin/Cyrillic or Russian; synonyms and typos tolerated). Without sort — ordered by relevance.","schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":100}},{"name":"sort","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Sort order.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["recommended","newest","best_selling","highest_payout","highest_stock","highest_lead_bonus"],"default":"recommended"}},{"name":"in_stock_only","in":"query","schema":{"type":"boolean","default":true},"description":"Only offers with stock > 0."},{"name":"min_sale_rate","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Minimum sale_rate_percent (0-100).","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":100}},{"name":"min_payout","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Minimum payout, UZS.","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}},{"name":"ids","in":"query","required":false,"des